## Root cause identification

Compared the still-failing directive (VTID-04014's own text, explicitly
naming the language: "Speak entirely in ${langName} — use no English
words ... compose the wording yourself in ${langName}") against
`override_v2`'s proven-reliable wording in the same file
(compute-greeting-decision.ts, rung 8) — override_v2 never names a
specific language at all.

